'''Plate''' is an [[NPC]] found within the {{Zone|Trial Grounds}} of {{Zone|The Mountaintop}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It only appears while competing with {{NPCSprite|Wizardman}} in his [[Wizardman#Temporal Race|Temporal Race]] trial.

== Purpose ==
'''Plate''' serves to tell the player to press the {{Rmt|&6&lREADY}} hologram to start {{NPCSprite|Wizardman}}'s [[Wizardman#Temporal Race|Temporal Race]]. 

